I just wait until I get a pick axe to get rid of the boulder and kill
the monster.  Of course, you will incur small luck penalty and you will
have 1 less boulders to waste.

Now, if you are SHORT of boulders, best method I found was to use the
guaranteed scroll of earth found there, read one and you have extra 9
boulders.

I do not know the penalty for getting that extra 9 boulders is.

